A '''Gimmiegold''' is a {{Rare}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Purple|Haunted}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Gimmiegolds''' spawn in the {{Purple|Haunted}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}} after throwing a {{Item|Shining Coin}} into the flooded basement of the mansion.

== Behavior ==
'''Gimmiegolds''' sit still after spawning. If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Gimmiegold''' and is caught, it dies and drops its loot.

